Generic single-database configuration.

Run the Schema Verification Script
Execute this from your current terminal window in the Backend directory:

powershell
# 1. Ensure APP_ENV is set to production and DATABASE_URL is set to ccure_db
$env:APP_ENV="production"
$env:DATABASE_URL="postgresql://ccure_user:ccure_admin_2026@127.0.0.1:5432/ccure_db"

# 2. Run the migration and initialization script
python -m db.migrate_production_schema

# 3. Clean up the environment overrides when done
Remove-Item Env:APP_ENV
Remove-Item Env:DATABASE_URL
